Bakit kailangang magbuhos ng enerhiya sa jade?

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.540
at nalilito ako?

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.500
Ito ay medyo nakakasakit

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.410
Parehong bagay

